OL,4,CTwo arrested and man sought over       
OL,5,C'altercation' by roadside              
OL,6,GTwo men have been arrested in          
OL,7,Gconnection with an "altercation"       
OL,8,Ginvolving a third man by the side of a 
OL,9,Groad in Fife.                          
OL,11,FOfficers were called to reports of an  
OL,12,Fincident on the A914 between St Monans 
OL,13,Fand Pittenweem at about 20:20 on       
OL,14,FSaturday evening.                      
OL,16,FThey said three men were involved in   
OL,17,Fthe dispute beside a parked red Ford   
OL,18,FTransit van near the road's junction   
OL,19,Fwith the B924.                         
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
