OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CSNP cancels #60,000 loan repayment     
OL,5,Cowed to Peter Murrell                  
OL,6,GThe SNP have written off #60,000 in    
OL,7,Goutstanding loan payments owed to the  
OL,8,Gparty's former chief executive, Peter  
OL,9,GMurrell, following his conviction for  
OL,10,Gembezzlement.                          
OL,12,FIn a statement, the party said it did  
OL,13,Fnot consider itself to have a          
OL,14,Fliability towards Murrell after he was 
OL,15,Fjailed earlier this year for illicitly 
OL,16,Fusing party funds to buy luxury goods, 
OL,17,Fvehicles and jewellery.                
OL,19,FThe decision was made following a      
OL,20,Fmeeting of the SNP's national          
OL,21,Fexecutive committee on Saturday.       
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
