OL,4,CAppeal after girl, 15, struck by car   
OL,5,Cin hit-and-run                         
OL,6,GPolice are appealing for information   
OL,7,Gafter a 15-year-old girl was struck by 
OL,8,Ga car in a hit-and-run in Dundee.      
OL,10,FThe incident happened in the           
OL,11,FNethergate area of the city at about   
OL,12,F20:50 on Wednesday.                    
OL,14,FThe teenager was crossing the road     
OL,15,Fwhen a white car moved from the        
OL,16,Fjunction at Whitehall Street towards   
OL,17,FChrichton Street where it hit her.     
OL,19,FPolice said the driver failed to stop. 
OL,20,FThe girl was taken to hospital but had 
OL,21,Fno serious injuries.                   
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
